---
import SectionLabel from './SectionLabel.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
const f = site.founder;
const isPh = (s: string) => /\[.*\]/.test(s);
---
<section id="founder" class="py-24 lg:py-32">
  <div class="container-x grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="lg:col-span-4" data-reveal>
      <div class="relative max-w-[340px]">
        <div class="absolute -inset-3 border border-line rounded-[1.6rem]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        {f.photo ? (
          <img src={f.photo} alt={f.name} width="680" height="820" loading="lazy" class="relative w-full aspect-[34/41] object-cover rounded-[1.25rem] grayscale-[15%]" />
        ) : (
          <div class="relative w-full aspect-[34/41] rounded-[1.25rem] bg-paper-2 blueprint-grid grid place-items-center">
            <span class="font-display text-7xl text-ink/25">{f.initials}</span>
            <span class="absolute bottom-4 font-mono text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">Founder photo goes here</span>
          </div>
        )}
        <p class="relative mt-6 font-display text-2xl text-ink"><span class:list={[isPh(f.name) && 'placeholder-mark']}>{f.name}</span></p>
        <p class="relative text-sm text-muted">{f.title}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-8" data-reveal style="--d:80ms">
      <SectionLabel n="09">Why remodelers</SectionLabel>
      <h2 class="mt-5 text-4xl sm:text-5xl">I’ll be straight with you.</h2>
      <div class="mt-7 space-y-5 text-lg text-body max-w-2xl">
        <p>
          Dscvred is new to remodeling. We don’t have a wall of remodeler case studies yet, and I’m not going to fake one.
        </p>
        <p>
          What I do have is <span class:list={[isPh(f.yearsExperience) && 'placeholder-mark']}>{f.yearsExperience}</span> years in growth marketing:
          paid search and social, SEO, landing pages and follow-up. As head of digital marketing for a high-ticket cosmetic clinic in Dubai,
          I took monthly leads from 150 to 1,500 and brought two Google-penalized websites back. Later I ran growth for a New York tech company,
          where marketing-influenced bookings grew 5× in two years.
        </p>
        <p>
          A cosmetic clinic and a remodeler have the same problem: big-ticket buyers, long decisions, and leads that go cold without fast follow-up.
          When I looked at where that experience matters most, remodelers kept coming up: big project values, owners who can sell,
          and a lead system that’s broken in exactly the ways I know how to fix.
        </p>
        <p>
          So we built one offer for one kind of business, put a guarantee on it, and we’re taking three founding partners to prove it.{' '}
          <strong class="text-ink">If we don’t deliver, you don’t pay us.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12">
        <p class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">Track record in other industries</p>
        <div class="mt-4 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          {site.results.map((r) => (
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line p-5">
              <p class="font-display text-4xl text-ink"><span class:list={[isPh(r.value) && 'placeholder-mark']}>{r.value}</span></p>
              <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-ink">{r.label}</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted"><span class:list={[isPh(r.context) && 'placeholder-mark']}>{r.context}</span></p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Results from in-house growth roles before Dscvred.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
